<h2 class="heading-size-3">Description</h2>The wolf hearts you acquired possess a quality unseen in similar specimens.  There is a toxicity to them that should be deadly to the very wolves in which the hearts beat!<br /><br />It's quite incredible, and we must study it further.  I kept a few samples of the hearts acquired.  Take them to my colleague, <a href="/forever/npc=5204/apothecary-zinge">Apothecary Zinge</a>.  You will find her in our headquarters in the <a href="/forever/zone=1497/undercity">Undercity</a>.

