<h2 class="heading-size-3">Description</h2>You! Quickly, I need you to bring this potion across the slime canal to <a href="/forever/npc=11044/doctor-martin-felben">Doctor Martin Felben</a> in the Apothecarium!

It has a very limited shelf life, and no I can't go myself, my knees rattle and pop out if I attempt to run.

Just another lovely side effect of undeath, apparently.

But we're wasting time! Here, take this and go!

&lt;Alessandro makes a shooing motion.&gt;

