<h2 class="heading-size-3">Description</h2>Now is the time to assault the Scourge's place of strength in Silverpine: Fenris Isle.<br /><br />You must again go to the Isle and destroy Thule Ravenclaw.  I want his head!<br /><br />This mission is as dangerous as it is vital, &lt;name&gt;.  You must not fail.

