<h2 class="heading-size-3">Description</h2>Oops!<br /><br />Had a little mishap, as you can see! The morning cargo shipment from Booty Bay was huge. Huge I say! Never seen so many crates. Well, I was trying to expedite things so I started unloading a bit more than I could handle. That's when everything came tumbling down.<br /><br />Before I knew what was going on, I saw that menace, Mad Magglish, go running off with a bottle of <a href="/forever/item=5334/99-year-old-port">99-year-old port</a>. Chased him all the way to <a href="/forever/zone=718/wailing-caverns">Wailing Caverns</a>. No way I was going in there.<br /><br />Maybe you're brave enough to find him?

