<h2 class="heading-size-3">Description</h2>As Naralex descended deeper into his nightmare, a strange breed of beasts arose from beneath the Barrens into the <a href="/forever/zone=718/wailing-caverns">Wailing Caverns</a>.<br /><br />These deviate creatures have strange, otherworldly properties. While evil in nature, it is my opinion that some good can come from their existence here in Kalimdor. I believe their hides will be of particular use in the ways of leatherworking.<br /><br />If you feel up to the task, venture into the caves below and retrieve some <a href="/forever/item=6443/deviate-hide">deviate hides</a>.

