<h2 class="heading-size-3">Description</h2>Ok, so the raptor horns didn't work so well.  But that's all right -- no one got rich on their first try!  And besides, I think I found something that'll work even better in my smart drinks!<br /><br />There is a substance called <a href="/forever/item=6464/wailing-essence">Wailing Essence</a>, and I think it is the cause of the strange plants and animals in the Barrens.  Get me some and I'll try it in my drink!<br /><br />I heard the essence gathers in ectoplasmic creatures in the <a href="/forever/zone=718/wailing-caverns">Wailing Caverns</a> to the west.  Hunt those creatures and gather the essence.

