<h2 class="heading-size-3">Description</h2>The herbs of the Barrens are not quite like herbs in other lands.  Their properties are mostly the same, but the oasis water here alters the plants; they are just slightly different.<br /><br />I want to study those differences... to see if they're exploitable!<br /><br />If you are skilled in herbalism, then gather <a href="/forever/item=5056/root-sample">root samples</a> off the herbs you find in the Barrens.  Bring back these samples so that I may compare them with herbs from other regions.
